<header class="page-header">
  <div class="page-header-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Review guide</p>
    <div class="page-header-title"><h1><%= @example.title %></h1></div>
    <p class="page-header-description"><%= @example.summary %></p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-header-actions"><%= link_to 'Open example', @example.start_path, class: 'button', data: {intent: 'primary'} %></div>
</header>
<div class="content-surface section-stack">
  <section class="stack" aria-labelledby="purpose-title">
    <h2 id="purpose-title"><%= @example.kind %></h2>
    <p><%= @example.purpose %></p>
  </section>
  <section class="stack" aria-labelledby="journey-title">
    <h2 id="journey-title">Try the workflow</h2>
    <ol class="stack"><% @example.steps.each do |step| %><li><%= step %></li><% end %></ol>
    <nav class="cluster" aria-label="Example entry points"><% @example.links.each do |label, path| %><%= link_to label, "/#{@example.slug}#{path}" %><% end %></nav>
  </section>
  <section class="stack" aria-labelledby="recovery-title">
    <h2 id="recovery-title">Review cases</h2>
    <p>Use the starting data for expected counts and values. Review with the keyboard, follow links and return with Back, then try the main task with JavaScript disabled.</p>
    <div class="stack" data-gap="section">
      <% @example.review_cases.each do |label, instruction, links| %>
        <div class="stack" data-gap="tight">
          <h3><%= label %></h3>
          <p><%= instruction %></p>
          <% if links.present? %>
            <nav class="cluster" aria-label="<%= label %>">
              <% links.each do |link_label, path| %><%= link_to link_label, "/#{@example.slug}#{path}" %><% end %>
            </nav>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="stack" aria-labelledby="restart-title">
    <h2 id="restart-title">Start again</h2>
    <p>Reset this example to repeat the workflow with its original data.</p>
    <% if @example.shared %><p class="hint">Its shared records reset for everyone using this local server. Other examples keep their data.</p><% end %>
    <div><%= link_to 'Reset example…', reset_review_example_path(@example.slug), class: 'button', data: {variant: 'quiet'} %></div>
  </section>
</div>
